          "book": "1CH",
          "chapter": 26,
          "verse": 30
        }
      ],
      "en": "Of the Hebronites, Hashabiah and his brothers, one thousand seven hundred men of valor, had the oversight of Israel beyond the Jordan westward, for all the business of the LORD and for the service of the king.",
      "ko": "헤브론 자손 중에 하사뱌와 그 동족 용사 일천 칠백인은 요단 서편에서 이스라엘을 주관하여 여호와의 모든 일과 왕을 섬기는 직임을 맡았으며",
      "source_text_hash": "aac5e981f30a7b65a8c8ad21b9fb0ca2c4c378b2812a4b311eab91db0ce8ddc8",
      "translation_text_hash": "cc79f5535bd680dfe822ad4a4f6392de15c155d965a430a4612ed87dadf725e1",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
